      "content": "thanks. we managed to get the backup compressor running but the reading is still fluctuating a bit. it's weird though, the maintenance logs look fine and there was no obvious physical damage to the unit. it just feels like the system is acting up for no reason. how do we figure out if it was a mechanical failure or if something else caused the sudden fluctuation?",
